  "text": "### 3.2 Audit Scope  \n**In Scope (All Areas Audited):**\n- Business processes (account opening, payment processing, etc.)\n- Financial controls (reconciliation, GL controls, etc.)\n- Operational controls (segregation of duties, authorization, etc.)\n- Compliance controls (KYC, AML, regulatory)\n- Technology controls (access, change management, backups)\n- Risk management (risk assessment, mitigation)\n- Fraud and misconduct investigations\n- Third-party vendors and service providers\n- Regulatory compliance  \n**Out of Scope (Not Audited):**\n- Board decisions (governance oversight, not audit)\n- Strategic decisions (unless control/compliance concern)\n- Items covered by external auditors (coordination, no duplication)",
